sub-title = Coming soon
sub-targets-text = Here you will add targets (name, RTMP or RTMPS address, key hidden), switch them on or off, check them before going live and remove them.
sub-recordings-text = Here you will start and stop the recording, choose the folder and open finished recordings.
sub-input-text = Here you will see the address to send to and the input key, shown once and renewed on request.
sub-log-text = Here you will read what happened, never with a key: targets connected, lost or refused.
sub-settings-text = Here you will set where the program listens (local by default) and the folder for recordings.
